card.statement:
Let $(A,m,\eta)$ be a monoid in $\calC$. Then $(A,\mu_-)$ forms a new Lie monoid in $\calC$, where

\begin{equation*}
\mu_- \ = \
\begin{tikzpicture}[anchorbase]
\draw[bmod] (0, 0)--(0,.25)--(0.25, 0.5)--(0.25,.75);
\draw[bmod] (0.5, 0) -- (.5, .25)-- (.25, .5);
\btoken{0.25,.5}{west}{m};
\end{tikzpicture} \ - \
\begin{tikzpicture}[anchorbase]
\draw[bmod] (0, 0)--(0.5,.25)--(0.25, 0.5)--(0.25,.75);
\draw[bmod] (0.5, 0) -- (0, .25)-- (.25, .5);
\btoken{0.25,.5}{west}{m};
\end{tikzpicture}\ .
\end{equation*}
